@MaSuperCalculette_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5109

### Get exec environment info
GET {{MaSuperCalculette_Api_HostAddress}}/Calculator/EnvironmentInfo
Accept: application/json

### Test Calcul
GET {{MaSuperCalculette_Api_HostAddress}}/Calculator/FaireCalcul?nombre1=10&operation=-&nombre2=3
Accept: application/json

